# Mobile-first

Design 390px first. `md:` is enhancement.

- Touch targets ≥44px
- App content `pb` must clear the bottom Limestone pill + `env(safe-area-inset-bottom)`
- Landing hero: stacked headline + full-width halftone (not 50vw)
- Sheets: `items-end` on mobile, centered on `md+`
- `theme-color` follows resolved theme (Pumice light / Obsidian dark)
- Grids: `grid-cols-2` default; add columns only at `md` / `lg`
